            "review_title": "Review at Thai Coffee",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nA great break from the road\nJun 2020\nOn our way back to Hanoi from a region just outside the metropolitan area, we decided to stop for coffee. This place had good reviews on another review site so we gave it a shot. It proved to be a really nice local spot, right across from the local government buildings. The staff was really friendly and quite amused at the foreigners who had found their way to this shop. But, the coconut coffee and the yogurt coffee were both really good and a very good value too. In fact, both were much better than I'd had over the previous few days in Hanoi. Do beware, like many places, they will place a bag of sunflower seeds on your table. They are not free. They are also not expensive if you want to eat them.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 24, 2020",
